# Keep the build context small and free of secrets / local state.
.git
**/node_modules
.next
out
coverage
test-results
playwright-report
tsconfig.tsbuildinfo
**/__pycache__
**/.pytest_cache
**/.ruff_cache
bridge/.venv
bridge/tests
bridge/tools
tests
audit
docs
deploy
# never send environment files (they may contain secrets) into the build
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/secrets*
# documentation is not needed in the image (bridge/README.md is: it is the package readme)
*.md
!bridge/README.md
